    "Solve one- and multi-dimensional kinematics problems using vectors and calculus.",
    "Apply Newton’s laws, conservation of energy and conservation of momentum.",
    "Analyze rotational motion and simple oscillatory systems.",
    "Use estimation, dimensional analysis and uncertainty-aware reasoning."
